Package: com.music27.tweak
Name: Music27
Version: 1.1.51
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: Restyle Apple Music on iOS 16/17 toward the iOS 26/27 Liquid Glass look. 1.1.51: every glyph in the album row is trimmed to its real bounding box and redrawn to one size with its contrast stretched, so the mirrored download glyph matches the shuffle glyph and the handover from the placeholder to the mirror is no longer visible.
Maintainer: Music27
Author: Music27
Section: Tweaks
Depends: mobilesubstrate (>= 0.9.5000), preferenceloader
